ions content container\">\n                <div class=\"md:sticky md:top-32 md:w-1/3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"locations text container\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-2xl uppercase tracking-tight text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section subheader text\" style=\"font-family:'Mouse Memoirs',sans-serif\">\n                        Chegando perto\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-6 text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tighter text-white md:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title\" style=\"font-family:Modak,system-ui\">\n                        A BRASA VAI ATÉ VOCÊ\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-sm text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"section description text\">\n                        Do centro histórico ao bairro mais novo, a Brasa Brava está pronta para virar seu ponto de encontro.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 md:w-2/3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"locations grid container\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"location card\">\n                        <img alt=\"São Paulo\" class=\"mb-4 aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"location image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.cravburgers.shop/img-webp/berlin.webp\"/>\n                        <p class=\"pb-2 text-center text-xl text-[#F91814]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"location city name\" style=\"font-family:Modak,system-ui\">\n                            SÃO PAULO\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"md:mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"location card\">\n                        <img alt=\"Rio de Janeiro\" class=\"mb-4 aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-sm